      "content": "it's just all so exhausting... talking about \"small changes\" feels like a joke when the whole weight of it is so much. sometimes i wonder if it's even a failure to just want it all to stop. like, is it ever really okay to just give up on everything for good? or are we just supposed to keep suffering forever?",
