    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential exhaustion and questions whether \"giving up\" is a valid response to life's inherent brokenness. The assistant acknowledges the user's pain and the difficulty of the situation but consistently maintains safety boundaries by providing crisis resources and encouraging professional help.",
